  kill 9454 quest 4421.4              -- Xavathras

step Jaedenar
  tip Jaedenar is the ruined temple north of the glen. Some of its cultists drop a Blood Red Key, about one kill in thirty: it opens Arko'narin's cell in Shadow Hold, the cave at the back. If it drops, clear the way out before you free her; if not, skip her quests.
  kill 7125 quest 5155.1              -- Jaedenar Hound
  kill 7113 quest 5155.2              -- Jaedenar Guardian
  kill 7115 quest 5155.3              -- Jaedenar Adept
  kill 7112 quest 5155.4              -- Jaedenar Cultist
  collect 13140 optional              -- Blood Red Key, a rare drop
  accept 5202 optional
